INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-9b24df9e9bb6','vale','Vale of Glamorgan Council','vale-of-glamorgan-council-email-correspondence-catalogue#t1','','Reply received: Information Request - BP Properties Ltd v Buckler (1987) - Request Reference 00209998','2025-12-23','Dear Sion Buckler

We are writing to introduce ourselves as the Council''s Information Governance Team, who handle requests for information. Your request regarding the above matter has been referred to us by the Council''s Legal Services Department.

We note that your request relates to a historic matter from 1987. As such, it may take some time for us to check records and consider any information that may be held. Please be aware that, due to the time that has passed, the Council may no longer hold information relating to this matter. If this is the case, we will do our best to offer advice that may assist you in continuing your enquiries.

We will write to you again as soon as possible. In the meantime, if you have any further questions or need clarification, please don''t hesitate to get in touch.
