INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-ca5e7fa1e113','cadw','Cadw / Welsh Government','welsh-government-and-cadw-email-correspondence-catalogue#t1','2026-01-23','Records of any archaeological notifications, alerts, or discoveries associated with Great House Farm, whether before or after demolition, including references to artefacts later recovered during excavations in the early 1990s.
Any documentation referring to historical associations between Great House Farm and early radio or wireless experimentation, including any mention of Guglielmo Marconi or related activity in the Cardiff Bay / Lavernock / surrounding area that may have been considered or dismissed.
If any information is withheld, please specify the exemption relied upon and provide the reasoning as required under the Act.

I would prefer to receive the information electronically, by email.

Please confirm receipt of this request too.

I understand that under the Freedom of Information Act you''re required to respond within 20 working days. It''s not that urgent so please take the time you need, within reason, and keep me updated where possible.

And if you have any questions, queries or concerns please feel free to reach out to me too.

Regards,

Sion Buckler
