INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-ff35a6d72da1','cadw','Cadw / Welsh Government','welsh-government-and-cadw-email-correspondence-catalogue#t2','2026-02-05','I truly believe I have the most befitting case, that I understand your department specifically exists to handle.

Is it not PACAC''s role to ensure that the *machinery of the state*—the courts, the Land Registry, and planning authorities—operates with transparency and protects the constitutional rights of citizens against administrative abuse?','2026-02-05','Diolch am eich ymholiad.
Nid yw''r blwchpost yma''n cael ei fonitro dros y penwythnos a gwyliau banc.
Os yw eich ymholiad ar frys, ffoniwch 0300 025 6000.

Thank you for your enquiry.
Please note that this mailbox is not monitored over the weekends or bank holidays.
If your enquiry is urgent, please call 0300 025 6000.
