INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-70c0b6d750dd','cadw','Cadw / Welsh Government','welsh-government-and-cadw-email-correspondence-catalogue#t2','2026-05-20','I have all my evidence. Consider CADW on notice.

All I''m asking is you cooperate to find out what really happened in this case.

I''m putting together the timeline and all evidence as I believe its in the public interest and I have reason to suspect fraud.

More so I believe my family have the rightful superior claim and manorial title.

As the possible, rightful possesor of lordship of manor of Llandough, I would be the executor of the estate.

Fraud unravels all. And the limitation clock only begins from discovery not occurance of fraud. Which is this year.

So please consider yourselves, CA','','','unanswered','unanswered','','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/welsh-government-and-cadw-email-correspondence-catalogue/#t2','');
