INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-46a8b2b378d8','hmlr','HM Land Registry','hm-land-registry-email-correspondence-catalogue#t3','2026-02-13','Diolch Lisa.

Sion','2026-03-23','The document attached is an official requisition, reminder or letter from HM Land Registry. It is not a circular and relates either to an application you have lodged with us or a property in which you have an interest. No paper copy of the item of correspondence will be sent to you.

The document is in ''Portable Document Format'' (PDF) which replicates the appearance of the hard copy version. You will need Adobe Acrobat Reader to open the document. If you do not already have Adobe Acrobat Reader it can be installed free from www.adobe.com. Please note that as the document is in PDF format you cannot add text to any document that you need to complete and return to HM Land Registry. You will have to return any such completed document by post.

Ymholiad, nodyn atgoffa neu lythyr swyddogol gan Gofrestrfa Tir EM yw''r ddogfen atodedig. Nid cylchlythyr yw hi ac mae''n ymwneud naill ai â chais rydych wedi ei gyflwyno i ni neu ag eiddo y mae gennych fudd ynddo. Ni chaiff copi papur o''r ohebiaeth ei anfon atoch.

Mae''r ddogfen ar ffurf ''Portable Document Format'' (PDF) sy''n dyblygu golwg y fersiwn copi caled. Bydd angen Adobe Acrobat Reader arnoch i agor y ddogfen. Os nad yw Adobe Acrobat Reader gennych yn barod, gallwch ei lwytho i lawr am ddim o www.adobe.com. Sylwch na fydd modd ichi ychwanegu testun at unrhyw ddogfen y mae''n rhaid ichi ei llenwi a dychwelyd i Gofrestrfa Tir EM gan ei bod ar ffurf PDF. Ar ôl ichi lenwi unrhyw ddogfen o''r fath bydd rhaid ichi ei dychwelyd trwy''r post.

HM Land Registry''s purpose is to protect your land ownership and provide services and data that underpin an efficient and informed property market. Our vision is: "A world-leading property market as part of a thriving economy and a sustainable future".

We check all mail and attachments for known viruses. However, you are advised that you open any attachments at your own risk. If you have received this email and it was not intended for you, please let us know, then delete it.

We welcome correspondence in English and Welsh.

To see how HM Land Registry treats your personal information, read our Personal information charter: www.gov.uk/government/organisations/land-registry/about/personal-information-charter.

Diben Cofrestrfa Tir EF yw gwarchod perchnogaeth eich tir a darparu gwasanaethau a data sy''n sail i farchnad eiddo effeithlon a gwybodus. Ein gweledigaeth yw: "Marchnad eiddo o''r radd flaenaf fel rhan o economi ffyniannus a dyfodol cynaliadwy".

Rydym yn gwirio pob neges ac atodia','provided','thread','','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/hm-land-registry-email-correspondence-catalogue/#t3','');
