INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-91e605652d19','hmlr','HM Land Registry','hm-land-registry-email-correspondence-catalogue#t3','2026-03-24','BP also appears to have failed to disclose the long‑running ownership dispute. In a 1978 suppressed newspaper article, my grandmother publicly asserted her ownership and stated that BP could not prove ownership and had never obtained a court ruling that it was the owner, only possession orders.

How was BP able to register our land in its name?
Did HM Land Registry enquire whether there was any dispute over the land, given that the dispute appears in court records from 1974?','2026-04-19','The document attached is an official requisition, reminder or letter from HM Land Registry. It is not a circular and relates either to an application you have lodged with us or a property in which you have an interest. No paper copy of the item of correspondence will be sent to you.

