INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-ae90f2f51f2f','hmlr','HM Land Registry','hm-land-registry-email-correspondence-catalogue#t3','2026-04-19','Accept that the combination of:
   - the identity mismatch (licence/name vs my grandmother’s true legal name), and
   - the timing (registration in 1982–83 before the 1987 decision) gives rise to at least a **serious question** as to whether the register is mistaken in showing BP/ Companies thereafter, as proprietors.
Confirm that, if it is ultimately determined that the register is mistaken and cannot be rectified without prejudice to third parties, HM Land Registry will treat me as having a potential claim for indemnity under Schedule 8.

Please also confirm any further documents you require (for example, copies of the licence, the BP v Buckler pleadings/judgment, and my grandmother’s certificates) so that the stage‑two review can consider the identity evidence in full.

Fraud unravels all. The limitation act also had a clause for fraud. Furthermore any limitation begins from discovery of fraud not occurrence of it.

The convenient and timely death of my nan after her two obstructed attempts to make her case in 1974, followed by my father''s convenient and timely death after his appeal of the 1987 case was dismissed and his ECHR obstructed, along with our forceful removal by 30 police and bailiffs in
1988. And the press reporting us as squatters on our ancestral birthland since 1667, did unlawfully dispossess and disposition us, but it doesn''t change the facts.

I see this case as instrumental in Wales'' decolonisation. Whereby us indigneous Welsh Nationals on our ancestral birthland are victim to a crime. And I am the only one willing to speak up and out as my family of mostly women, are all too traumatised by this crime.

It''s evident illicit profits and gains. Identity fraud. And negligence and incompetence. I absolutely see the Brit-ish Establishment that now occupy and rule through fo','2026-04-19','Enquiry Reference: 260419-6067119

Dear Customer

Please do not reply to this email. This mailbox is not monitored.

Thank you for contacting HM Land Registry. Your reference number is 260419-6067119 .

We usually reply to online enquiries within five working days but depending on the nature of your enquiry this could take up to 20 days. Please bear with us and we will respond as quickly as we can.

We will respond to Data Protection Act requests within one month and Freedom of Information Act requests within twenty working days.

In the meantime, you may find an answer to your enquiry at www.gov.uk/land-registry<https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/land-registry/>.

If you have used one of our email addresses we suggest using our Contact Form for any future correspondence to help us route your enquiry in the most efficient way.

The security and confidentiality of all personal data is maintained in accordance with our Personal Information Charter<https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/land-registry/about/personal-information-charter>.

Read more about our service standards<https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/land-registry/about-our-services#complaints>.

Peidiwch ag ateb yr ebost hwn. Nid yw’r blwch negeseuon ebost hwn yn cael ei fonitro.

Diolch am gysylltu â Chofrestrfa Tir EF. Eich rhif cyfeirnod yw 260419-6067119 .

Fel rheol, rydym yn ymateb i ymholiadau ar-lein o fewn pum niwrnod gwaith ond yn dibynnu ar natur eich ymholiad, gall gymryd hyd at 20 niwrnod. Gofynnwn ichi fod yn amyneddgar gyda ni – byddwn yn ymateb cyn gynted ag y gallwn.

Byddwn yn ymateb i geisiadau’r Ddeddf Diogelu Data o fewn mis a cheisiadau’r Ddeddf Rhyddid Gwybodaeth o fewn ugain niwrnod gwaith.

Yn y cyfamser, efallai cewch ateb i’ch ymholiad yn www.gov.uk/land-registry.cy<http://www.gov.uk/land-registry.cy>

Os ydych wedi defnyddio un o’n cyfeiriadau ebost, awgrymwn eich bod yn defnyddio’n Ffurflen Gysylltu ar gyfer unrhyw ohebiaeth yn y dyfodol i’n helpu i gyfeirio’ch ymholiad yn y ffordd fwyaf effeithlon.

Cedwir diogelwch a chyfrinachedd yr holl ddata personol yn unol â’n Siarter Gwybodaeth Bersonol<https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/land-registry/about/personal-information-charter.cy>.

Darllenwch ragor am ein safonau gwasanaeth<https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/land-registry/about-our-services.cy> .

