INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-d4fcf1ea27a0','hmlr','HM Land Registry','hm-land-registry-email-correspondence-catalogue#t3','2026-04-21','Karen,

Thanks for your reply.

Regards,

Sion Buckler','2026-04-26','Dear Sion Buckler,
Our records show you recently made a complaint about HM Land Registry.
We want to ensure all our customers have the best possible experience, including if they are making a complaint.
To do this, we would be grateful if you could provide feedback on the process of making a complaint.
Thinking about the complaints process, rather than the outcome, we invite you to comment on anything we did well or could have done better.
Please select the link below to take our five minute survey.
[Take Survey <https://public-gbr.mkt.dynamics.com/api/orgs/8dab633e-21a6-41e2-9048-b2acbabe2e10/r/hYEC0tSBYUi6FlhkfH8CAAsAAAA?msdynmkt_target=%7B%22TargetUrl%22%3A%22https%253A%252F%252Femea.dcv.ms%252FnZ9l22tjzk%22%2C%22RedirectOptions%22%3A%7B%225%22%3Anull%2C%221%22%3Anull%7D%7D&msdynmkt_digest=RePFhRotkVfYX%2Bm9aoCuPkzsA29H6cL5iT%2FkN4wevPA%3D&msdynmkt_secretVersion=a175536a73764d0380b10b26ce0aed92>]
Many thanks in advance.
Best Wishes
Richard Turner
Customer Insight and Experience Manager
