INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-586e38dfdd35','vale','Vale of Glamorgan Council','vale-of-glamorgan-council-email-correspondence-catalogue#t4','2026-05-20','Any documents discussing:

• estate ownership
• occupation history
• family occupation or association
• agricultural use
• commemorative tree planting or memorial planting
• estate boundaries
• title history
• acquisition history
• disputes concerning ownership, heritage status or land use
• estate restructuring, extinguishment, compulsory acquisition or title
alteration.
Copies of all material linked to GGAT03586s and GGATE003872, including
the archaeological assessment and associated correspondence.
Any records identifying historic occupants, proprietors, tenants or
family associations, including references to the Williams family where
present within archives.
Metadata identifying file creators, accession history, provenance, dates
and retention schedules.
File indexes, archive references or schedules identifying further
related material not already listed.

Please provide information electronically where possible.

If any material is withheld, please identify the exemption relied upon and
provide the public interest assessment.

Regards,

Sion Buckler

[redacted]','2026-05-27','Dear Sion Buckler

FREEDOM OF INFORMATION ACT 2000/ENVIRONMENTAL INFORMATION REGULATIONS 2004 - INFORMATION REQUEST

Thank you for your request for information about: Great House Farm, Williams/ Buckler Family, Llandough, Vale of Glamorgan

Your request was received on 20/05/2026 and is being considered under the terms of the Freedom of Information Act 2000 and the Environmental Information Regulations 2004. Your query has been given the reference 00210772.

In some circumstances a fee may be payable and if that is the case we will let you know. A fees notice will be issued to you, and you will be required to pay before we will proceed to deal with your request.

You should receive the information requested within 20 working days unless the Council does not hold the information or there is a reason for it to be withheld. We will write to you in any event.

If you have any requirements regarding the format any information should be supplied in, e.g. the language to be used, audio, large print and so on, then if you have not already done so please let us know.

If you have any queries or concerns then please do not hesitate to contact us. Please remember to quote the reference number above in any future communications.

