INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-043e865c1838','heneb','Heneb / GGAT','heneb-ggat-email-correspondence-catalogue#t2','2026-05-20','Any documents discussing:

• estate ownership
• occupation history
• family occupation or association
• agricultural use
• commemorative tree planting or memorial planting
• estate boundaries
• title history
• acquisition history
• disputes concerning ownership, heritage status or land use
• estate restructuring, extinguishment, compulsory acquisition or title alteration.
Copies of all material linked to GGAT03586s and GGATE003872, including the archaeological assessment and associated correspondence.
Any records identifying historic occupants, proprietors, tenants or family associations, including references to the Williams family where present within archives.
Metadata identifying file creators, accession history, provenance, dates and retention schedules.
File indexes, archive references or schedules identifying further related material not already listed.

Please provide information electronically where possible.

If any material is withheld, please identify the exemption relied upon and provide the public interest assessment.

Regards,

Sion Buckler

[redacted]','2026-05-22','Dear Mr Buckler,

Thank you for your email. Heneb is not subject to FOI requests as we are a Limited company. However, if you fill out our Enquiry Form<https://heneb.jotform.com/form/240392792819366> then we will be happy to assist as best we can.

Kind regards,

Calli','reply','thread','','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/heneb-ggat-email-correspondence-catalogue/#t2','');
