Planning Approvals and Local Authority Governance

   - All minutes, planning commi','2026-05-29','Dear member of the public.
Please note that South Wales Police no longer accepts reports via email. To make a report, we kindly request that you utilise one of the following options:
1. In case of an emergency, please call 999 immediately.
2. For non-emergency situations, please use our online Single Online Home (SOH) web form found in the reports section of at https://www.south-wales.police.uk/
By using the Single Online Home, you can provide us with accurate and comprehensive information, which will enable us to respond effectively and prioritise resources accordingly.
We appreciate your understanding and cooperation in adopting these preferred reporting channels.
Sincerely,
South Wales Police
[Welsh Language Translation]
Annwyl breswylydd,
Noder nad yw Heddlu De Cymru yn derbyn adroddiadau drwy e-bost mwyach. Dylid gwneud pob adroddiad gan ddefnyddio un o''r opsiynau canlynol:
1. Mewn achos brys, ffoniwch 999 ar unwaith,
2. Mewn sefyllfaoedd nad ydynt yn rhai brys, defnyddiwch ein ffurfleni rhoi gwybod ar-lein sydd ar gael ar ein gwefan https://www.south-wales.police.uk/cy-GB/
Rydym yn gwerthfawrogi eich dealltwriaeth a''ch cydweithrediad wrth fabwysiadu''r sianeli rhoi gwybod hyn a ffefrir.
Yn gywir, Heddlu De Cymru

Ymateb nad yw''n Argyfwng\ Non-Emergency Response

Oes angen i chi siarad â''r heddlu ond nid oes angen ymateb brys arnoch? Gallwch roi gwybod am fater drwy ein gwefan https://www.heddlu-de-cymru.police.uk, neu ffonio 101. Gallwch ddefnyddio 101 i roi gwybod am achosion nad ydynt yn rhai brys i unrhyw heddlu yng Nghymru a Lloegr. Mewn argyfwng, ffoniwch 999 bob amser.

Do you need to speak to the police but don’t require an emergency response? You can make a report via our website https://www.south-wales.police.uk, or call 101. 101 can be used to report a non-emergency to any force in Wales and England. In an emergency always dial 999.

Cymorth Iaith Gymraeg\Welsh Language Support

Mae Heddlu De Cymru yn croesawu derbyn gohebiaeth yn Gymraeg a Saesneg. Byddwn yn ateb gohebiaeth a dderbynnir yn Gymraeg yn Gymraeg ac ni fydd gohebu yn Gymraeg yn arwain at oedi.

South Wales Police welcomes receiving correspondence in Welsh and English. Any correspondence received in Welsh will be answered in Welsh and corresponding in Welsh will not lead to a delay in responding.

