INSERT INTO qa_fts VALUES ('qa-575ffa29d4ca','Thanks. Name please?','Good morning,

Your request for information has now been considered and our response is attached.

I trust that this information answers your request. Should you have any queries and wish to contact us by e-mail, please do so using the mail box information@south-wales.police.uk .

South Wales Police provides you the right to request a re-examination of your case under its review procedure (copy attached). If you decide to request such a review and having followed the Forces full process you are still dissatisfied, then you have the right to direct your comments to the Information Commissioner who will give it consideration.

Kind regards,

