INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-935d89ad439c','swp','South Wales Police','south-wales-police-email-correspondence-catalogue-part-2#t3','','Reply received: Freedom of Information request 719/26','2026-06-22','Good Morning,

I write to advise that I am in receipt of your e-mail dated 07/06/2026.

This letter confirms that your request has now been passed to our FOI officers who will review the contents of your request and establish if a) your request is valid under the FOI Act and b) if any further clarification is required from you to allow us to progress further.

All requests require a response within the 20 working day deadline, therefore you should receive a response by/or on the 6th of July 2026.

Should you wish to contact us regarding your request, please quote reference number 719/26 on any correspondence. Should you wish to contact us by e-mail, please do so using the mailbox Information@south-wales.police.uk<mailto:Information@south-wales.police.uk>.

Kind Regards,

Swyddog Datgelu | Disclosure Officer
Rheolwr Rheoli Data a Datgeliadau | Data Management and Disclosure Unit
Pencadlys Heddlu De Cymru | South Wales Police Headquarters

