INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-d538eb5ba867','cadw','Cadw / Welsh Government','welsh-government-and-cadw-email-correspondence-catalogue#t5','2026-06-16','Ms Longford,

Thank you for the acknowledgement letter and for handling the internal review.

For the record, my communications with Cadw have been enquiries and requests for information under FOI/EIR (ATISN 27021), specifically regarding the statutory listing history, assessments and related records (including the 1988 inspection photographs) for the building known as Great House Farm / Ty Mawr / Church View Close. I subsequently requested an internal review of the response provided.

This was not framed or intended as a formal complaint. I would therefore be grateful if the matter could be t','2026-06-16','Dear Mr Buckler,

Many thanks for the quick response and for confirming your position. I totally understand and whilst the letters may appear formal, there are set templates to use for a review, I will bear this in mind whilst taking this forward.

Just to let you know, I have had initial conversations internally which I will continue. I will keep you updated as best as I can.

Kind Regards

Amy','reply','thread','','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/welsh-government-and-cadw-email-correspondence-catalogue/#t5','cq-1881-name,cq-listing');
INSERT INTO qa_fts VALUES ('qa-d538eb5ba867','Ms Longford,

Thank you for the acknowledgement letter and for handling the internal review.

For the record, my communications with Cadw have been enquiries and requests for information under FOI/EIR (ATISN 27021), specifically regarding the statutory listing history, assessments and related records (including the 1988 inspection photographs) for the building known as Great House Farm / Ty Mawr / Church View Close. I subsequently requested an internal review of the response provided.

This was not framed or intended as a formal complaint. I would therefore be grateful if the matter could be t','Dear Mr Buckler,

Many thanks for the quick response and for confirming your position. I totally understand and whilst the letters may appear formal, there are set templates to use for a review, I will bear this in mind whilst taking this forward.

Just to let you know, I have had initial conversations internally which I will continue. I will keep you updated as best as I can.

Kind Regards

Amy','Cadw / Welsh Government');
