INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-ffd5f51bfee7','cadw','Cadw / Welsh Government','welsh-government-and-cadw-email-correspondence-catalogue#t5','2026-07-02','Please therefore identify the documentary basis upon which the original response concluded that the property was assessed and found not to meet the listing criteria.

Specifically:

   - Is that conclusion derived from a surviving record?
Does the Welsh Government''s position now amount to one of the following:

   - that Great House Farm was never considered for statutory protection;
   - that it was considered, but the records no longer survive; or
   - that it is no longer possible to determine whether consideration took place because the relevant records are unavailable?','2026-07-03','Dear Mr Buckler,

Many thanks for the email. This is a courtesy response to say that I will review your questions below and aim to get a response back to you by the 17th July.

Kind Regards

Amy','reply','thread','','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/welsh-government-and-cadw-email-correspondence-catalogue/#t5','cq-1881-name');
