INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-208b2cecda49','museum','Amgueddfa Cymru – Museum Wales','amgueddfa-cymru-museum-wales-email-correspondence-catalogue#t1','2026-07-02','Freedom of Information Act 2000 Request

Sir/Madam,

I am making this request under the Freedom of Information Act 2000.

I seek all recorded information held concerning furniture, furnishings, antiques, fixtures, heirlooms and other movable property originating from Great House Farm (Ty Mawr), Llandough, including any and all items we received from Bute Estate, Cardiff Castle, Cardiff Council. Weather it be museums, archives or any other public body. I know museums have artifacts from our land in Llandough.

Specifically, I request copies of all:

1. Inventories, catalogues and asset register','2026-07-13','Dear Sion

We note that your request was addressed to Cardiff Council, with Amgueddfa Cymru copied into the correspondence. Please confirm whether you intended this request to be made to Amgueddfa Cymru as well.

Cofion cynnes,

FOI Team
Amgueddfa Cymru','reply','thread','','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/amgueddfa-cymru-museum-wales-email-correspondence-catalogue/#t1','cq-1881-name');
