INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-529b90d5cf5e','vale','Vale of Glamorgan Council','vale-of-glamorgan-council-email-correspondence-catalogue#t7','2026-10-07','A non-disclosive description of the further documentation located (date range, creator/supplier, how it came into the Council’s possession, approximate volume);
Confirmation that the newly located documentation is being preserved without alteration, destruction or disposal; and
Immediate release of any material that can properly be disclosed without awaiting third-party consultation.

None of those four points has been answered.

What you have not said
You have not identified a single document found in the September sift. You have not named any third-party consultee class, the date any consultation was sent, or the date by which a reply was required. You have not stated whether the material is held under EIR or FOIA. You have not addressed the child / personal-data point previously raised. You have not confirmed a preservation hold. Silence on each of these points is itself a recorded position.

What is now required (unchanged from the unanswered requests)
Issue the internal review decision. On any view the ICO’s recommended maximum of 40 working days from the request for review (7 July 2026) has long passed. If you contend that EIR does not apply, say so expressly and identify the statutory basis for treating the request under FOIA alone.
Attach a schedule of every document found in the further search: date, description, format, holding service, whether Council or third-party record in the Council’s possession, and the decision on each (disclose / part-disclose / withhold with the precise regulation or section).
Confirm in writing that every document in the sift, and every related planning, enforcement, legal, committee, land, finance and correspondence record (including predecessor-authority material), is under a formal preservation hold and will not be destroyed, weeded, transferred or disposed of while 00210772 and related requests remain open.
Address the child / personal-data point: if any record has been withheld or is being considered for withholding because','','','unanswered','unanswered','','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/vale-of-glamorgan-council-email-correspondence-catalogue/#t7','');
