INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-26a4a880979f','glamarch','Glamorgan Archives','gmail:1a02ad4c2f0fd6e3','2026-08-22','Daniel Thomas, Alfred Thomas and the Llandough lime works

Please identify any documents linking *Daniel Thomas*, or his son *Alfred
Thomas (later Lord Pontypridd)*, with:

   - land at Llandough;
   - the Llandough lime works or lime kilns;
   - quarrying operations;
   - Great House Farm or adjoining agricultural land;
   - any freehold or leasehold interest in the area.

I would be particularly interested in estate papers, correspondence,
conveyances, wills, probate-related estate records, rentals, rent books,
abstracts of title and plans that may trace what became of any Daniel
Thomas interest after his death or thereafter.','2026-09-07','If you have not already got a copy of Daniel Thomas’ will, you can apply for a copy of probate from the Probate Office: Search probate records for documents and wills (England and Wales) - GOV.UK.','provided','item','','https://mail.google.com/mail/?authuser=[redacted]#all/thread-a:r-2236227807529852386|msg-f:1875692337105865063','cq-1877,cq-1881-name,cq-1928');
