INSERT INTO qa VALUES ('qa-715ff1aca1bc','glamarch','Glamorgan Archives','gmail:1a07b3bf0b65e56c','2026-09-07','Photography for copies to Patagonia — rules.

**22 August 2026 — no reply**

24–29. DBDT10/19 and 10/20 identification of Daniel Thomas; Bute–Thomas
search at Llandough juxta Penarth; quarry/lime/reversion instruments
(poor-rate occupation already seen); later title; research cost.

**26 August 2026 — no reply**
30–35. Physical examination of original **DBDT79/1** (catalogued May 1877,
Pembroke Terrace). Treat as a different instrument from the Nov 1877
Llandough counterpart unless you confirm they are the same.

Regards,

Sion Buckler
Reader''s ticket 2004093

Open Drafts and send when ready.
On Mon, 7 Sept 2026, 06:38 Glamro / Swyddfa Cofnodion Morgannwg, <
Glamro@cardiff.gov.uk> wrote:','2026-09-24','Photography for copies to Patagonia — rules.
Please find attached the digital photography order form which applies wherever you are based. As mentioned above, prices quoted do not include VAT due to your location. You need to sign and agree to the declaration on the order form.

**22 August 2026 — no reply**

24–29. DBDT10/19 and 10/20 identification of Daniel Thomas; Bute–Thomas search at Llandough juxta Penarth; quarry/lime/reversion instruments (poor-rate occupation already seen); later title; research cost.
These points were answered in my email of 7th September.

