INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('m-fdaafb0497ad','hmlr','2026-02-02T12:01:00Z','received','Further to Your Enquiry: Ref: 260202-5732372','Enquiry Reference: 260202-5732372

Dear Customer

Thank you for your email dated 31 January 2026.

Unfortunately, it is not clear from your email what the allegations of fraud/potential irregularities in 1982 land registration are?

In order for us to investigate further, please can you provide us with either the full address of the property or the title number concerned.

Can you explain /provide full details of what has happened?

If the matter has been referred to the Police (please provide police incident number) and advise us, if any legal advice has been taken regarding the matter

It is important to note that HM Land Registry can only consider and investigate circumstances in which an alleged fraud relates to actual or planned changes to the register. (registration)

Yours faithfully

S.-G. Haste
HM Land Registry
reportafraud@landregistry.gov.uk<mailto:reportafraud@landregistry.gov.uk>

We only provide factual information and impartial advice about our procedures. Read more about the advice we give.<https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/hm-land-registry-service-standards/our-service-standards>

HM Land Registry''s purpose is to protect your land ownership and provide services and data that underpin an efficient and informed property market. Our vision is: "A world-leading property market as part of a thriving economy and a sustainable future".

We check all mail and attachments for known viruses. However, you are advised that you open any attachments at your own risk. If you have received this email and it was not intended for you, please let us know, then delete it.

We welcome correspondence in English and Welsh.

To see how HM Land Registry treats your personal information, read our Personal information charter: www.gov.uk/government/organisations/land-registry/about/personal-information-charter.','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/hm-land-registry-email-correspondence-catalogue/#t2');
