This request concerns the full first registration case files, including all supporting documentation, correspondence, internal notes, and any associated index map search material.

I am specifically requesting permission to:
Inspect the physical archived files (or digital scans if the originals are not accessible)
Review all documents submitted in support of the applications

Review any examiner notes, requisitions, or internal annotations made during processing

Identify any records of third-party claims, disputes, objections, or references to adverse occupation or competing claims
Confirm whether any such material was present on the file at the time of registration
If the files are no longer held in physical form, please confirm:

the date and manner of destruction (if applicable), or

whether they have been digitised or transferred to another archive location If inspection is not possible, I would be grateful if you could instead provide certified copies of the complete file contents.

Please also confirm the procedure for arranging an appointment for inspection, including any identification or fees required.

Regards,

Sion Buckler and heirs of Mary Williams of Great House Farm, Llandough C/O [redacted], United Kingdom');
