INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('m-bc4e6efab029','cadw','2026-06-16T04:37:00Z','sent','Re: REVIEW of EOI ATISN 27021','Ms Longford,

Thank you for the acknowledgement letter and for handling the internal review.

For the record, my communications with Cadw have been enquiries and requests for information under FOI/EIR (ATISN 27021), specifically regarding the statutory listing history, assessments and related records (including the 1988 inspection photographs) for the building known as Great House Farm / Ty Mawr / Church View Close. I subsequently requested an internal review of the response provided.

This was not framed or intended as a formal complaint. I would therefore be grateful if the matter could be treated and recorded as an information request and internal review under FOI/EIR, rather than as a complaint.

My enquiries concern Cadw''s functions in relation to the listing and assessment of the building only.

Regards,
Sion Buckler (Ret''d Sergeant)
Military Cyber & Electronic Warfare Professional
Life Member: Royal Corps of Signals','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/welsh-government-and-cadw-email-correspondence-catalogue/#t5');
