INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('m-824a8765abef','museum','2026-07-13T17:57:00Z','sent','Re: Great House Farm, Llandough | Cardiff Castle Furniture','Yes please.

I am trying to gather all information.
Mine and my families claim to ownership of the land was never extinguished, as confirmed by the land registry recently. This land is my birthplace and I am the heir and successor to the claim. I was in the home when we were dispossessed of it and when it was demolished in front of us in 1988.

So this is not just an enquiry from a member of the public. This concerns my interest in the land and my personal story and data.

Thank you in advance for any assistance you can provide.

Regards,

Sion Buckler (Ret''d Sergenant)
Royal Signals Cyber & Electronic Warfare Professional & Life Member
[redacted]','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/amgueddfa-cymru-museum-wales-email-correspondence-catalogue/#t1');
