INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('g-1a07b3bf0b65e56c','glamarch','2026-09-07T09:36:38Z','received','RE: Epexio contact us form submission','Ref: 2026 – 3941

Dear Sion Buckler,

Thank you for your e-mail received 29th August regarding obtaining a copy of document reference ACA/8/2.

Alternatively, we offer a “copying” service at Glamorgan Archives. We have listed the costs below for your viewing.

Charges
Single image (digital copy)
£15.60
Subsequent images (per image, from same document)
£4.80
Multiple images from multiple documents (per hour)
£60.00

We can confirm that the volume contains 106 pages so would require 53 images – total cost £60 (for one hour work)

If you would like to use this service please complete and return the attached form. Once received we will send instructions on how to pay for the service.

Please let us know if you have additional queries.

Yours sincerely

Alexis Brito
