INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('m-1b32409d270c','museum','2026-09-08T09:08:00Z','received','FOI: 2026-036 - Great House Farm, Llandough, Cardiff','Dear Mr Buckler

Thank you for your email.

I note that this request covers the same subject matter as FOI:2026-032 and extends the scope of the information requested in that case.

In order to avoid duplication and ensure that we provide a single, comprehensive response, our intention is to treat FOI:2026-036 as replacing FOI:2026-032 and to close FOI:2026-032 accordingly.

Unless we hear from you to the contrary within the next few working days, we will proceed on that basis and respond to the broader request contained in FOI:2026-036.

Please note that your request for an internal review of FOI:2026-024 remains a separate matter and will continue to be considered independently.

