I know with what happened in the last century with our farmhouse involved a lot of scandle, in order to disposses us of our country treasure 800 year old home, which we owned, before being removed by force from the land we still own, and demolishing our home since 1667 to develop 20 houses in its place, which the entire community petitioned when the plan was just 13 houses, and on a roman villa and monestry and medieval burial site, which authories knew full well was there. I''m just trying to get answers for my family and to understand what exactly happened in a fact find and on an evidence basis. But the Llandough councillors refusal to respond and the non response from MPs is a further outrage on what is already a very sensitive subject. My surviving family who didn''t die in mysterious ways at convenient times during all this, have been too terrified to speak up or out again about any of this, living like hostages under the occupying British, suffering in silence for the last 38 straight years. And the land registry responses also raise more questions. Many local authorities take the maximum time to respond at each interval. Our family are having to re-live a horrendous ordeal, to even say anything about our home and lands true history and herritage and the defective title upon which 20 family homes now exist.

The narrative and public records are all very wrong and misleading and deceiving. I have corroborating family testimony confirming records were removed/ stolen and not just from our home but the public library. Many institutions report gaps in records and cannot account for destroyed/ missing records.

So I thank you in advance for your co-operation in this matter. I believe a collective effort will mean a lot should the Senedd authorise a public enquiry or my family get justice. But this was and still is a matter of national public interest.

Marconi was staying with us at our home there, in 1897, while conducting the successful experiment of radio at Lavernock Point. Meanwhile Cardiff Council refuse to even put the inventors name on the statue of the radio at Cardiff Bay because Cardiff is now a city of sanctuary and Marconi was right wing politically. And alledgedly an anti semite, but my research from that also suggests that wasn''t the case. I''m actually having to depend on Germanies spy''s accounts of what happened between my family and Marconi due to the Brit''ish States concealment and rewriting of history.

