family and the origin is a 1000 year freehold from Knight Sir Herbert of
Swansea to Vaughan in the 1500''s.

BPs interest in our parcel was a 1969 purchase of interest in an unenforced
(possible undeclaired) possession order, by Western Ground Rents, based on
