Marconi''s stay with us is covered up. Even unto this day. Along with the
Roman Villa, Monestry, Peerless Jims first fight in our barns. Even the
2,200 year old round house isn''t mentioned. Why? Llandough has been turned
into a concentration work camp. The town website history page doesn''t even
mention the half of this. Also all the campaigning to petition the housing
development (on our land) in 1974 and affirm our home was a county
treasure, was suppressed. When BP demolished our home in 1988 and went back
to the Vale council for planning approval. The council never held BP to
account for just demolishing our country treasure home. And even suppressed
or down played any record it was ever a county treasure property. Or site
of historic and archelogical signifcants.

I am not just writing about my disappointment in the councillor. I know
he''s likely already been scolded by the aforementioned terrorists that
outrank him, in the aftermath of rejecting being replaced and ethnically
cleansed which resulted in him being ejected from a council meeting for
challenging Cardiff being a city of Sanctuary. My motto is different in
that I say "Bring Guns" and am fully aware everything comes down to guns
and fire fights. So I will always need an actual gun to be fired at me or
held to my head to make me even consider standing down. And even then the
last 3 times firearms have been drawn on me I ended up disarming the
aggressor. So I''m perhaps a different breed to the councillor or civilians
