INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('m-73d9b7578187','hmlr','2026-09-21T11:51:00Z','received','Further to Your Enquiry: Ref: 260919-6726246','Enquiry Reference: 260919-6726246

Dear Customer

Thank you for your enquiry.

Your email address is not registered for the Search for land and property <https://www.gov.uk/search-property-information-land-registry>service. If you have not accessed your account for over a year, then your account is deleted in line with our terms of use <https://terms.landregistry.gov.uk/terms_of_use/search?lang=en>

I have looked at the title number you hav quoted and this is not a current title number, this title appears to have been closed in 2005 and therefore no copy of the register is available. If there is an address you are searching you can use our service above.

Yours faithfully

Sandra
HM Land Registry

We only provide factual information and impartial advice about our procedures. Read more about the advice we give.<https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/hm-land-registry-service-standards/our-service-standards>

Easy and free support to help you work with HM Land Registry:
