INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('g-1a0d677d2f33f0ab','tna','2026-09-25T02:49:31Z','sent','Re: Freedom of Information Request: Reference CAS-347296-M0V4Y1 (internal review)','Please treat this email as a formal request for internal review.

1. Please confirm the date on which the physical records comprising YHL/PO/JO/10/11/2536 were transferred into the custody of The National Archives; the accession/transfer reference; whether the transfer paperwork identifies the transferring body; whether the physical records were already in TNA''s custody during my earlier enquiries in August 2026; and whether the 20 May 2026 date refers solely to publication of catalogue metadata.

2. Please clarify whether the initial search was limited to the four property/location terms and the PRO/RW series; why BP Properties Ltd, expressly identified in my request, was not included in that initial search; and whether any search log or audit trail exists.

3. Were any searches conducted between 20 May 2026 and 13 August 2026, and did they include “BP Properties Ltd” or the case title?

4. Do the transfer records show the date of transfer, previous custody, whether transferred directly from the Parliamentary Archives, whether any associated material was excluded, withheld, destroyed or retained elsewhere?

5. Where information is not held, please distinguish between (a) no such records were ever transferred, (b) transferred elsewhere, (c) destroyed/disposed of, and (d) absence of a discoverable catalogue reference.','https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#all/1a0cf0a5c1c2a0a0');
