INSERT INTO messages_fts VALUES ('m-ec230c791e1c','Further to Your Enquiry: Ref: 260918-6720625 Title No: WA240304','Enquiry Reference: 260918-6720625 Title Number: WA240304

Dear Customer

Thank you for your enquiry. I have referred it for consideration by the appropriate team.

HM Land Registry: processing times - GOV.UK<https://www.gov.uk/guidance/hm-land-registry-processing-times> may assist you. It provides information on how we are delivering our services.

To contact us

If you are an HM Land Registry Portal customer:

Please use “Reply to Requisition” or the View Applications “Respond” function. This will attach your correspondence to the application.

Please use the View Applications<https://www.gov.uk/guidance/view-my-applications#using-view-applications> function to view and manage your applications.

If you are not a Portal customer / if you are a citizen customer:

Please reply to this email.

Yours faithfully

Sara
HM Land Registry

We only provide factual information and impartial advice about our procedures. Read more about the advice we give.<https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/hm-land-registry-service-standards/our-service-standards>

