INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('m-2e7618fc3e7c','cps','2026-09-29T17:49:00Z','received','Great House Farm / suspected historic fraud','Dear Mr Buckler

Thank you for your email dated 28 September 2026.

Unfortunately, I have been unable to locate a case file based on the information provided. Our reference numbers are known as Unique Reference Numbers (URNs) and follow a format similar to: 62HA... followed by seven digits.

Could you please contact the officer in the case to request the CPS reference number, if it has been issued.

We look forward to receiving the necessary information so that we can assist you with your enquiry. Please provide this by 13 October 2026.

Yours sincerely

L Rutter
Rheolwr Cyswllt Dioddefwyr / Victim Liaison Officer
