INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('m-d94aea53686c','cadw','2026-09-30T08:41:00Z','received','RE: Supplement to complaint re-served 20 September 2026 — Great House Farm (Tŷ Mawr), Llandough','Good morning Mr Buckler,

Your correspondence has been received by the Welsh Government Complaints advice team.

The complaints policy allows us to consider complaints about Welsh Government’s administrative actions (i.e. maladministration) or service failure by us. The policy is available by post on request and can also be found on our website: How to make a complaint about Welsh Government [HTML] | GOV.WALES<https://www.gov.wales/how-make-complaint-about-welsh-government-html>.

The Policy does not allow us to consider complaints about a decision which has not involved maladministration.

Your concerns will be addressed by the relevant officials within Welsh Government, who will respond to you directly and as soon as possible.

Best Regards,

Steffan Herdman
Rheolwr Cwynion / Complaints Manager
Y Tîm Cynghori ar Gwynion / Complaints Advice Team
Gweithrediadau a Chyflenwi AD / HR Operations and Delivery
Cyfarwyddiaeth Pobl a Lleoedd / People and Places Directorate
Llywodraeth Cymru / Welsh Government','https://greathousefarmwiki.wordpress.com/records-access-chronology/foi-reply-register/welsh-government-and-cadw-email-correspondence-catalogue-part-2/#t3');
