INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('g-1a110a1e67c69f50','glamarch','2026-10-06T09:53:24Z','received','RE: Enquiry — does D153/1–8 contain a c.1875–1880 Llandough-juxta-Penarth instrument?','The majority of your email relates to document reference D153/1–8. As discussed in previous emails, this is a reference for material held at the National Library of Wales so you should contact them about these records. Detailed descriptions can be found on their online catalogue: Deeds relating to premises in p. Llandough, co. Glam., comprising a dwelling house adjoining the churchyard, 1811 (D153/1-2), land (19 ...

D/DRa 11/120 is an old way of formatting our reference DRA/11/120. This forms part of the series DRA/11/1-293 which comprises lawsuits, instructions to counsel, opinions etc. relating to undermining of house property, flooding, contravention of colliery regulations, 1856-1909 in respect of Elder’s Navigation Colliery, Maesteg. This doesn’t seem relevant to your research and doesn’t relate to Tynywain either. Can you point us to where you found this reference so that we can assist further?','https://mail.google.com/mail/u/0/#all/1a0ac815c712ae7c');
