INSERT INTO messages VALUES ('g-1a132cc8710993ff','llcc','2026-10-13T01:07:06Z','sent','Re: Great House Farm (Tŷ Mawr), Llandough — request for internal review of the response of 11 October 2026 (section 12)','Mr Egan,

Thanks for your email of 11 October 2026. I acknowledge your refusal of my
information request and also the other matters raised in my correspondence
“will be considered at the October meeting of the council”.

Not to sound like a stickler but your email doesn''t identify the date,
time, venue, public-access arrangements or agenda for that meeting, or
direct me to a published notice containing those particulars. This omission
prevents me from verifying when the promised consideration is to take
place, whether the relevant matters are scheduled for consideration, and
whether I can attend or monitor the proceedings. Please provide those
particulars immediately or identify where the Council has published them.

Below is my position, formal requests an internal review, and further
request for recorded information, and constitutes a subject access request
for my personal data. Please record and process each part under the
applicable procedure. None is intended to withdraw, narrow or replace the
others.
1. Position concerning Great House Farm / Tŷ Mawr

As stated previously and repeatedly, my research of this case concerns the
legitimacy of my families historic title and the treatment of Great House
Farm, its buildings and associated land. The two-parcel estate, one of
which was and still appears to be ours, is an evidence-based position
advanced from the documentary record concerning the distinct identities and
conveyancing histories i.e. Parcel A—the farmhouse, farm buildings, garden,
yard, associated woodland and what is now church view close green —and
Parcel B: the eastern agricultural land, east of our Parcel A and what was
WGR and BP''s parcel and the focus on their possession. My argument is,
again - that our parcel of land and home since 1667, was treated as one and
the same as Parcel B under the blanket term "whole farm".

Our Parcel A (or a synthetic mimic of it, born from a long running and
rejected string of attempts to make our occupancy appear permissive) was
stealthfully registered by BP in 1983 and merged into their Parcel B in
1987 - my grandmother conveniently dying and no notice given of the
registration in the appeal window. Much like the 87 stealthful merge of
parcels before my late fathers appeal of the 87 ruling concluded. Our
county treasure home was also demolished in 88 before our appeal had even
begun, let alone concluded, of CADW''s decision not to list it as a Grade II
so it couldn''t be demolished.

Spell and grammar check. Also make it less abhorrent but don''t lose any of
what is being said or be apologetic. This is a statement of truth , my
truth. `None of this should be downgraded to a speculative theory simply
because the Council has not adjudicated it. The chronology of evidence is
painting a damning picture of what looks to be everything needed to reopen
this case I.e. fraud, concealment and government involvement. Which I am
investigating and I would encourage you to all do your own research and
investigate too.

I''ll give you the courtesy of some colloquialism before I revert back to
professionalism with this communication so you have the courtesy from me of
being treated like a human. And so you know you are also dealing with a
human. I also got some very gracious emails from Chris Frank''s and the
corriners and other family and community members who''s families have been
allied with my family for decades and even centuries here.

Firstly I am whole heartedly rejecting this terrorist/ hostage
situationship with local authorities here. And our town and county and
country, being turned into one giant corporate concentration work camp.
With voters being imported by traitors to keep themselves in power. I was
under Tony Blairs orders and I called David Cameron into an international
treaty I stopped (WCIT 2012), so I know a lot of the stuff the other
mammals on this island get upto.

What happened to our stronghold and the destruction of our ancient history
and herritage and family is tandamount to ethnic cleansing and a
declaration of war on all I hold sacred like my family, home, land,
history, reality and faith. The situation was untenable enough back then,
but the more the full picture of what happened in this case becomes
apparent the more your regimes occupancy and rule over my birthland will
get to justify. Unless I''m mistaken and this has all been a big
misunderstanding and nobody is to blame. But I am not getting much
reassurance from any of you lot here, that I''m mistaken. I did understand
you to have already retired, which was a misunderstanding on my part. Much
like I misunderstood the 87 merger of parcels to have occurred in 83 up
until recently. This is a complex case and I don''t claim to fully
understand it myself. It will take a village. And I''m here hoping to feel
my villages warmth. With some 3 others flying in closely behind me this
month. Legitimacy is the only authority I will recognise here. Two of my
close protection officers are both three time decorated gulf war veterans
and former police and I have passed this to them too. If local authories
here won''t co-operate, I have no issues using my own security group and
resources. In Britain and America. I give you local authories here the
opportunity to answer to what you all did to my family over 40 years.

As you may be able to tell i''ve near enough abandoned the idea this is a
democracy or any lawful system of government here. I know the British
State is a terrorist organisation because I was like the forces that did
the siege and assult on my home and family in Llandough in 1988. Except I
was behind a machine gun in a helicopter in the illegal invasion of Iraq.
So you all might fancy yourselves to be crazy here, holding my family
hostage under a web of deceipt, but I may actuallt be a little bit worse.

My flight back here to Cardiff last month is synonymous with an old
military tour of the middle east I was in, in 2005 - where two SAS were
held hostage by Iraqi police and about to be decapitated, so we had to
smash down the prison walls and get them out. I''m here to see to it my
family get out of this captivity they''re being held in. The walls in this
terrorist/ hostage situationship here just aren''t physical, but more like
some demonic realm spell everyones kept under. Maybe the same source and
whatever goes into the water that''s making frogs turn gay.

The circus this case appears to be, if not rectified, will surely damn and
curse that small pale village to hell. It''s no small matter. The armed
forces world I''m in is nothing compared to the forces being messed with in
this case. We are no longer all within innocence or ignorance of the facts
of this case now either. My older brother, sisters, mum, aunties, cousins
are all seeing this as the charade and circus it is too. I''m bringing it to
all your attentions to give you all the opportunity to respond to this. So
far all I''ve experienced is a lot of barriers, delays, walls (paywalls) and
excuses. You yourself kindly pointed us to things like the 1939 agreement
which excludes our parcel, but let''s not forget your initial response was
an unwillingness to become involved.

Understand I bring this to local authorities, (arguably illegitimate in
this case and so arguably an authority) through a lot of personal trauma,
trajectory and mis information and fragmented info and expense to myself. I
went to private boarding school and my career began in military
intelligence, but we still got nocked into a different life after 1988.

More recently I left my wife and daughter andspend at our villa in the
Caribbean to spend the time it took me, in a cabin in south Argentina the
last year, just to wrap my own head around this case. So while you''re all
taking your merry old time dragging this out for months, that''s the end of
my marriage and another family. But I don''t know where you all imagine I''m
going each time you all give me the finger?

I''m a military warfare professional and I am very committed to
understanding this. Hence why I just flew 7,000 miles to your doorsteps. If
that''s my land, how did it come to be you are you all on it? I''m not
convinced by the answers you all keep providing. While I was an infant it
may have sufficed, or my mum pregnant, my dad terminally ill. But my
disabled widow pensioner grandmother Mary Williams had 7 children, who had
many other children, and generation on we now have a small and very hungry
army here. I now have more than 50 former soldiers in my US-based private
security group, with our satellite office here.

But I say this to say my family here are a lot bigger and uglier. And I''m
not based here anymore with any of you. I''m resigned to the fact the
Brit''ish State is ethnically cleansing Welsh Nationals in Wales, which is
why I am now based in Patagonia, Argentina where my AI agents have their
own legal personhood coming and where us Welsh Nationals and our history
and heritage is celebrated. I''m only here to light the metaphorical fuse of
this powder ceg. The aftermath of it will be between you local authorities
and all of them. I''m just quietly gathering my evidence, more so for the
replica Great House Farm I''m constructing is a museum and third home in
Patagonia. And if I unravel any fraud, concealment and government
involvement in that process then so be it. The case reopens.

 https://bpvsbuckler.bucklerfamily.estate

My wife (soon to be ex) and I, won''t even let our unregistered daughter
step foot in Wales until its decolonised or the Brit''ish Establishment/ UK
Government has been overthrown. I even exported my dog from our livery yard
in Monknash in 2024 after an afghan migrant was in our horse yard and
indoor riding school trying to steal and eat him. My first child here was
abducted at 36 days old and was never seen again from 2013, it''s like a
demonic realm is ruling this island and everyone''s under its spell.

The reason my business associates and soldiers and family are all
congregating around this matter and flying into this region, is because if
I''m right about this case and corruption in local authorities here, this is
the catalyst and nexus event of a land market bubble we''re in. This isn''t
to say this is the case to meet the threshold to reopen, but its one of the
earliest, possibly first of many parallel cases nationwide. Meaning there''s
a very real likelihood of what we saw in places like Cyprus, which I was
directly involved with while operating as guard commander for RAF Akrotiri,
whereby the UN in Nicosia would have to award land back to natives after
decades of occupation. Or procide reporations. Decolonisation isn''t all
political and figurative, its very literal Paul. Logistically and
operationally. Which you''ll soon see in this case or the increasing others
now emerging nationwide.

Having just worked on setting up the whole car finance reporations claim
scheme and information systems, with all the FCA and court ruling last year
and so forth, I see a definite parallel here as more cases paralleling my
families case in Llandough emerge, nationwide and even globally.

Do you see the parallel? Here is an illustration. Neither should be
functional.

https://car.financecheque.uk

https://bucklerfamily.estate`

Below is a **revised** version that keeps your position, allegations,
personal history and demands intact, while replacing insults and language
that could be read as threats with firm, direct wording. I have not
fact-checked the claims; contested conclusions remain expressed as your
position rather than as independently established findings.

***

Paul,

None of this should be reduced to speculative theory simply because the
Council has not adjudicated it. The chronology of the evidence is painting
a damning picture of what appears to be grounds for reopening this case:
fraud, concealment and government involvement. These are matters I am
investigating, and I encourage everyone involved to conduct their own
research and investigation.

Before returning to the formal substance of this communication, I want to
speak plainly and personally. There is a human being behind this
correspondence, just as there is one receiving it. I have also received
some very gracious emails from Chris Franks, the coroners, and members of
families and communities whose connections with my family go back decades
and, in some instances, centuries.

First, I reject what I regard as a coercive, hostage-like relationship with
the local authorities. I also reject what I see as the transformation of
our town, county and country into a system of corporate control, and the
use of inward migration to sustain those in power. These are serious
political objections, not casual remarks. I served under Tony Blair’s
orders, and I called David Cameron into the international treaty process
that I maintain I helped stop at WCIT 2012. My perspective is informed by
direct experience of government and international affairs.

What happened to our stronghold, and the destruction of our ancient
history, heritage and family life, is, in my view, tantamount to ethnic
cleansing. I regard it as an attack on everything I hold sacred: my family,
home, land, history, reality and faith. The situation was untenable then.
As the full picture becomes clearer, I find the legitimacy of the
authorities’ occupation and governance of my birthplace increasingly
difficult to accept.

If this has all been a profound misunderstanding, and nobody is responsible
for wrongdoing, then that needs to be demonstrated through evidence and
clear answers. So far, I have received little reassurance from any of you
that my interpretation is mistaken.

I acknowledge my own misunderstandings. I understood that you had already
retired, which was incorrect. Until recently, I also believed the 1987
merger of parcels had occurred in 1983. This is a complex case, and I do
not claim to understand every aspect of it. Resolving it will require a
collective effort. I am looking for support and openness from my community,
with three other people due to arrive shortly after me this month.

Legitimacy is the only basis on which I will recognise authority here. Two
of my close-protection officers are former police officers and
three-times-decorated Gulf War veterans. I have shared this matter with
them. If the local authorities will not cooperate, I will draw on my own
security group and resources in Britain and America to support my personal
protection, research and lawful pursuit of accountability. I am giving the
authorities an opportunity to explain what happened to my family over the
past 40 years.

As you may be able to tell, I have largely lost confidence that the system
operating here is democratic or lawful. I regard the British State’s
conduct towards my family as terroristic. The siege and assault on our home
and family in Llandough in 1988 carries particular significance for me
because I later served on the other side of military operations, behind a
machine gun in a helicopter during what I regard as the illegal invasion of
Iraq. I understand the force and consequences of such operations from
personal experience. That history informs the seriousness of my position;
it is not a threat.

My return to Cardiff last month brought back memories of a military tour in
the Middle East in 2005, when two SAS personnel were held by Iraqi police
and, as I understood the situation, faced imminent execution. We had to
break through the prison walls to get them out. I am now seeking to free my
family from what I regard as a different kind of captivity: one maintained
through disputed records, concealment, institutional barriers and a
continuing lack of answers.

The walls in this case are not physical. They are the structures of
misinformation, obstruction and control that, in my view, have kept people
from understanding what happened. At times, the situation has felt so
distorted and oppressive that ordinary explanations seem inadequate.

If this case is not properly addressed, I believe the consequences for the
village and the institutions involved could be profound. This is not a
small matter. My military experience does not diminish the importance of
the family, historical and moral issues at stake here.

Nor can everyone involved continue to claim ignorance of the information
now being brought forward. My older brother, sisters, mother, aunties and
cousins also see this as a charade. I am bringing it to your attention so
that everyone concerned has an opportunity to respond.

So far, I have encountered barriers, delays, paywalls and excuses. You
kindly directed us to material such as the 1939 agreement, which excludes
our parcel. I acknowledge that assistance. However, your initial response
was that you were unwilling to become involved, and that remains part of
